teymen Allensman (Netherlands) Tobias Foss (Norway) Filippo Ganna (Italy) Axel Laurence (France) Conor Swift (UK) geraint Thomas (UK) Samuel Watson (UK) Young riders Allensman and Laurence will be crucial in supporting rodriguez,alongside the recently crowned British champion, Samuel Watson . Watsonâs recent success extends to winning the overall championship in the Dunkirk four-day race (UCI2.Pro) in May, solidifying his position as a promising talent. Filippo Ganna is expected to excel in the two individual time trials, aiming for his first stage victory since his 2022 Tour debut.
